 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Network Connectivity API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Hubs, spokes and gateway advertised routes are configuration metadata: no route is exchanged, no VPC, VPN, Interconnect, router appliance or gateway capacity is connected, and every resource reports ACTIVE immediately. A spoke names its hub and exactly one linked resource or gateway; the simulator derives spokeType from it but does not resolve the hub or linked resources, check route-advertisement parents, or block deleting a hub with spokes. Spoke acceptance and rejection, hub groups, route tables, listSpokes and queryStatus are not implemented. Long-running operations complete synchronously.",
  "title": "Network Connectivity Center (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
